  "splashText": "<b>Welcome to MercNET, Commander:</b> \n\n GN Wars is a mod centered around an online asynchronous War Map and a Discord community. Players are encouraged to join the Discord community and participate, though participation is optional. Form factions and friendships as you strive for glory through multiple means of conquest. \n\n <b>https://discord.gg/twJ9Yw3kcH</b> \n\n <b>Important:</b> The default difficulty setup is configured in a way that the average player can affect the Online War Map. It's important to note that a difficulty level that is too high or too low may result in situations where gains are wasted or too small to affect planetary control. \n\n It's important that you play at a difficulty that is fun because having fun is why we're here.",
